<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <title>M5 Permissions - No Data</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif; margin: 20px; }
    .header { background: #f5f5f5; padding: 15px; border-radius: 4px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
    .header h1 { margin: 0 0 10px 0; }
    .nav { margin: 10px 0; }
    .nav a { margin-right: 15px; text-decoration: none; color: #0066cc; }
    .message { background: #fff3cd; padding: 15px; border-radius: 4px; color: #856404; border-left: 4px solid #ffc107; }
    .message h2 { margin-top: 0; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="header">
    <h1>M5 Permissions & Audit</h1>
    <p>Session: <strong><%= @session.id %></strong></p>
    <div class="nav">
      <a href="/">Sessions</a>
      <a href="/sessions/<%= @session.id %>">Transcript</a>
      <a href="/sessions/<%= @session.id %>/tokens">Tokens</a>
      <a href="/sessions/<%= @session.id %>/permissions">Permissions (M5)</a>
      <a href="/sessions/<%= @session.id %>/actors">Actors (M5)</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="message">
    <h2>⚠️ Audit Database Not Available</h2>
    <p>The audit trail database (<code>.boukensha/events.db</code>) was not found or is not accessible.</p>
    <h3>To enable M5 permission recording:</h3>
    <ol>
      <li>Wrap your agent's registry with <code>GuardedRegistry</code>:
        <pre style="background: #f9f9f9; padding: 10px; border-radius: 4px; overflow-x: auto;">
from boukensha.control import GuardedRegistry, Actor, Role, ...

actor = Actor("scout", "Scout", Role.PLAYER, "session-id")
policy = ... # your permission policy
audit = AuditLog(".boukensha/events.db")

agent.registry = GuardedRegistry(
    agent.registry,
    actor=actor,
    policy=policy,
    hooks=hooks,
    logger=logger,
    audit=audit,
)</pre>
      </li>
      <li>Run your agent</li>
      <li>The audit database will be created automatically</li>
      <li>Refresh this page to see the permissions and audit trail</li>
    </ol>
    <h3>See Also:</h3>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code-camp-2026/tree/main/week2_capable">M5 Documentation</a></li>
      <li><a href="/sessions/<%= @session.id %>/permissions">View Permissions Dashboard</a></li>
      <li><a href="/sessions/<%= @session.id %>/actors">View Actors Dashboard</a></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
